SUMMARY:NAIDOC Week – Botanical Eco-Printing & Dot Art Workshops
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate NAIDOC Week by discovering natural colours through bo
 tanical eco-printing and learning Aboriginal storytelling traditions with 
 dot art. These free\, hands-on workshops are available at various librarie
 s across the Sunshine Coast.
LOCATION:Coolum\, Kawana\, Caloundra\, Nambour & Maroochydore Libraries
URL:https://www.sunshinecoast.qld.gov.au/naidoc-regional-guide
