UID:sunnycoast-2@dothings
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260703
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260703
SUMMARY:LORE | Land – Exhibition Opening
DESCRIPTION:An exhibition grounded in First Nations deep cultural knowledge
  and ancestral connections\, led by Jinibara artist Jennifer Kent and feat
 uring the First Nations Screenprint Collective. 'Old Ways\, New Marks' sho
 wcases contemporary screen-print works by emerging First Nations artists\,
  revealing enduring relationships with land\, culture\, and community whil
 e exploring themes of identity and resistance.
LOCATION:Caloundra Regional Gallery\, 22 Omrah Avenue\, Caloundra
URL:https://gallery.sunshinecoast.qld.gov.au/exhibitions
END:VEVENT
